  "title_en": "Xi's Call to Strengthen the Military",
  "summary_zh": "习近平主席多次强调强国必须强军，军强才能国安，文章重温统帅的强军号令。",
  "summary_en": "President Xi Jinping has repeatedly stressed that a strong country must have a strong military, and only a strong military can ensure national security. This article revisits the commander's call.",
